1
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,320
=Episode 3=

2
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,320
Xi Yuan, set the carrier pigeon aside.

3
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,000
Surrender yourself.

4
00:00:26,239 --> 00:00:26,800
Your Highness,

5
00:00:27,239 --> 00:00:28,399
I'm just eating a roasted pigeon.

6
00:00:28,719 --> 00:00:29,359
That's not a crime, is it?

7
00:00:29,559 --> 00:00:31,519
(Boy-crazy and a glutton.)

8
00:00:31,519 --> 00:00:32,000
Your Highness,

9
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:34,399
the message is almost completely burned.

10
00:00:34,399 --> 00:00:35,839
Did we misjudge her?

11
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:36,480
Your Highness,

12
00:00:36,559 --> 00:00:37,679
want a drumstick?

13
00:00:37,679 --> 00:00:38,379
Hey!

14
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,759
Eating on duty?

15
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,399
Go clean the Archive Pavilion.

16
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:43,320
Don't come back

17
00:00:43,799 --> 00:00:44,479
until it's spotless.

18
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:47,640
Get moving!

19
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:49,920
(You took my pigeon.)

20
00:00:54,159 --> 00:00:56,439
The Treasure Pavilion is
a highly classified military site,

21
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:59,079
housing countless treasures and
ancient texts.

22
00:00:59,679 --> 00:01:00,640
Obtaining even one

23
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,799
would be a merit above all others.

24
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,399
That's brilliant, Your Highness.

25
00:01:04,799 --> 00:01:06,159
If that girl is a Huangyan spy,

26
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,640
she'll definitely slip up.

27
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:10,079
What?

28
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,280
A personal handmaiden?

29
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:15,000
Why does His Highness

30
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,400
care so much about protecting

31
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:17,879
that wretched lowborn woman?

32
00:01:17,879 --> 00:01:19,079
My lady, fret not.

33
00:01:19,239 --> 00:01:20,439
With your strength,

34
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:22,519
I'm sure you'll make Xi Yuan

35
00:01:22,719 --> 00:01:23,760
embarrass herself

36
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,680
on the day of the martial trial.

37
00:01:25,079 --> 00:01:27,200
Am I supposed to wait until that day

38
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,359
and watch His Highness go easy on her?

39
00:01:31,879 --> 00:01:32,640
You're right, my lady.

40
00:01:33,959 --> 00:01:34,879
Once she's dead,

41
00:01:35,599 --> 00:01:36,599
her name will be forgotten.

42
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,079
Let's see how she competes with me then.

43
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:50,239
The Huyun Imperial Palace is massive,

44
00:01:50,239 --> 00:01:51,359
and the Archive Pavilion

45
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,760
has nothing but a single table?

46
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,480
What's there even to clean?

47
00:01:59,319 --> 00:01:59,959
All done.

48
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:10,640
How...

49
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:14,000
How am I supposed to clean this?

50
00:02:14,639 --> 00:02:16,360
Jin Yunlie,

51
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,360
you set me up!

52
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,240
Your Highness.

53
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:23,960
What is it?

54
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,400
She showed no interest in the maps

55
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,080
and military documents we planted.

56
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:29,360
At first she was cleaning seriously.

57
00:02:29,439 --> 00:02:30,319
Then...

58
00:02:31,759 --> 00:02:32,599
She fell asleep.

59
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,639
(A glutton and a sleepyhead.)

60
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:38,039
(I should've known this silly girl
couldn't be a spy.)

61
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:41,719
(But why doesn't she remember her past?)

62
00:02:42,439 --> 00:02:43,759
(Did she lose her memory?)

63
00:02:44,759 --> 00:02:45,719
(Perhaps it's for the best.)

64
00:02:46,039 --> 00:02:47,120
(She's a little dumb,)

65
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,199
(a bit slow,)

66
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,479
(but also a bit)

67
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:50,719
(endearing.)

68
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,039
Ouch!

69
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:54,840
That hurts.

70
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,560
Why would Huangyan send

71
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,319
such a dim-witted person as a spy?

72
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:08,879
Symbiotic Bond.

73
00:03:09,159 --> 00:03:12,319
A legendary symbiotic spell
bestowed by deities.

74
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,479
When two people truly in love

75
00:03:14,479 --> 00:03:15,800
form this bond,

76
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,560
they become linked to each other.

77
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:19,960
From then on,
their love becomes vitality.

78
00:03:20,599 --> 00:03:22,199
Whenever one is wounded and bleeding,

79
00:03:22,759 --> 00:03:23,800
pressing foreheads together

80
00:03:24,759 --> 00:03:26,439
allows them to heal each other.

81
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,800
A Symbiotic Bond meant to
exist between deities...

82
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,680
Why has it been confirmed
between the two of us?

83
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:49,440
♪I shut out the world, you're all I see♪

84
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:52,800
♪One glance to last forever,
just you and me♪

85
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:55,520
♪Though deep in bone this longing stays,
a few more glances cast♪

86
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,759
♪An everlasting love to hold,
forever made to last♪

87
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:58,879
So it was fate all along.

88
00:03:59,039 --> 00:04:01,439
You didn't come to Huyun for Huangyan,

89
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:02,759
you came for me.

90
00:04:03,759 --> 00:04:05,879
I made you some mung bean cakes.

91
00:04:06,319 --> 00:04:06,960
Try one.

92
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,640
♪Once the heart knows love's design♪

93
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:12,920
♪It's you I seek, and intertwine♪

94
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:15,920
Wait.

95
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,759
(Is she trying to
conquer my stomach first?)

96
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:26,639
Alright now.

97
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:29,120
Since I've been behaving
pretty well lately,

98
00:04:29,519 --> 00:04:30,839
could you teach me a few moves?

99
00:04:31,759 --> 00:04:32,360
We'll see.

100
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,439
So stubborn.

101
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:43,920
How unbelievable!

102
00:04:44,279 --> 00:04:45,319
Fine, I don't care.

103
00:04:45,879 --> 00:04:47,519
No way I can't learn on my own.

104
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:48,759
Let me think.

105
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:50,120
How do they do it in those dramas?

106
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,680
Tidal Crash!

107
00:04:58,439 --> 00:05:00,120
Tidal Crash again!

108
00:05:05,079 --> 00:05:05,539
Ha!

109
00:05:08,879 --> 00:05:09,199
Are...

110
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:09,920
Are you alright?

111
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:10,319
He's fine.

112
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,079
As for you...

113
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,040
Wh...

114
00:05:13,639 --> 00:05:14,000
Wh...

115
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:14,519
What?

116
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:15,720
I'll teach you to cultivate.

117
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,879
I begged you before and you wouldn't.

118
00:05:18,879 --> 00:05:20,319
Why so generous now?

119
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:22,120
Naturally, His Highness is merciful.

120
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,560
He'd rather you not die in the arena.

121
00:05:23,839 --> 00:05:24,279
You talk too much.

122
00:05:26,439 --> 00:05:27,319
Your Spirit Core just opened.

123
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,600
Start with the absolute basics.

124
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:30,600
Got it!

125
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:40,160
Feel the flow of Spiritual Energy
within you.

126
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,639
Gather it here.

127
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,879
The Spiritual Energy in your dantian

128
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,600
will circulate throughout your body.

129
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:53,600
Do you feel it?

130
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,040
Nope.

131
00:06:01,959 --> 00:06:02,360
Here,

132
00:06:02,879 --> 00:06:03,199
and here,

133
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,519
is all the path

134
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:05,839
the Spirit Energy must take
to burst through your fingertips.

135
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,079
Alright.

136
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,040
Now, follow this force.

137
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,279
Channel your Spiritual Power

138
00:06:10,519 --> 00:06:11,560
to your fingertips.

139
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:17,160
♪I shut out the world, you're all I see♪

140
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:21,500
♪One glance to last forever,
just you and me♪

141
00:06:21,519 --> 00:06:22,360
What's wrong?

142
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,279
Nothing.

143
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:25,800
Focus.

144
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:26,720
Alright.

145
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:30,800
♪After the world fades away,
you alone stay in my sight♪

146
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:35,320
♪Rouge sachets and jade towers
can't match your dance in the light♪

147
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:36,759
♪Once the heart knows love's design♪

148
00:06:36,759 --> 00:06:38,240
An average cultivator

149
00:06:38,959 --> 00:06:40,240
needs at least three months

150
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,360
just to gather Spiritual Energy.

151
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,480
To attack with a Spirit Sphere,

152
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:44,720
it'd take about a year of practice.

153
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,120
Your Spirit Core just opened.

154
00:06:46,439 --> 00:06:47,240
Don't rush.

155
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:48,879
With time

156
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:49,920
and enough practice,

157
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:50,959
you'll surely...

158
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:53,480
Look!

159
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,639
I did it!

160
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,279
Not bad.

161
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:58,279
Keep going.

162
00:06:58,319 --> 00:06:58,839
On it!

163
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:01,600
Don't rush.

164
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:02,519
Channel it.

165
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:03,480
Right.

166
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:09,040
♪Who can forget the dreams
once held and lost♪

167
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:12,320
♪Petals on your shoulder reveal your charm♪

168
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:15,640
♪For whom does the wind shift so quiet♪

169
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:18,920
♪That is my silent confession in bloom♪

170
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:22,160
♪I shut out the world, you're all I see♪

171
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:23,040
Wow!

172
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:23,920
Look!

173
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:24,800
Am I awesome or what?

174
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:27,880
♪Though deep in bone this longing stays♪

175
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:29,160
♪A few more glances cast♪

176
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:32,280
♪An everlasting love to hold,
forever made to last♪

177
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:35,920
♪After the world fades away,
you alone stay in my sight♪

178
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:39,920
♪Rouge sachets and jade towers
can't match your dance in the light♪

179
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:43,400
♪Once the heart knows love's design,
it's you I seek♪

180
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,640
♪And intertwine♪

181
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:48,399
You have talent,

182
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,120
but if you can't use it effectively,

183
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,680
you may not gain the upper hand

184
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:53,000
in the arena.

185
00:07:53,319 --> 00:07:53,720
Yeah.

186
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,279
I have some matters to attend to today.

187
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,079
Wait.

188
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,560
What is this?

189
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,360
This is a Whispering Bell.

190
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,040
Infuse just a little Spiritual Power,

191
00:08:06,279 --> 00:08:07,199
and you can call me

192
00:08:07,199 --> 00:08:08,199
anytime, anywhere.

193
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:11,199
So it's basically a phone
in the cultivation world?

194
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:15,360
Where is he?

195
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:20,720
Your Highness,

196
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,920
your mother left you
the Whispering Bell.

197
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:24,480
You just gave it to her?

198
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:25,319
(Xi Yuan,)

199
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:27,800
(since you came here
wholeheartedly for me,)

200
00:08:28,079 --> 00:08:29,879
(I will protect you for a lifetime.)

201
00:08:29,879 --> 00:08:30,440
(Longyuan Kingdom)

202
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:40,200
(Qing Yuluo, Longyuan's Second Prince)

203
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:45,679
Great Demon Lord,

204
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:47,720
I have delivered your blood
to the Xia family as instructed.

205
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,399
They can coordinate with us from within.

206
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,360
Once we get the Xuanji Jade,

207
00:08:50,559 --> 00:08:51,240
then

208
00:08:51,399 --> 00:08:53,320
you will be able to descend
upon this world once more.

209
00:08:55,639 --> 00:08:56,519
Great Demon Lord?

210
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,399
It seems

211
00:09:01,159 --> 00:09:02,399
the Great Demon Lord's power

212
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:04,639
is still very weak right now.

213
00:09:07,519 --> 00:09:08,159
I will

214
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:10,120
leave you to recover in peace.

215
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:11,639
Once the task is complete,

216
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,799
I will report back.

217
00:09:15,759 --> 00:09:18,200
Spiritual Power rises from the dantian,

218
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:21,960
and circulates throughout the body.

219
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:31,799
Next,

220
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,120
practice my attack.

221
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,000
Watch out!

222
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:46,919
It's you?

223
00:09:47,399 --> 00:09:48,360
What do you want?

224
00:09:49,039 --> 00:09:50,080
Keep watch.

225
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:50,799
Understood.

226
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:56,039
When I first met you,

227
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:56,960
we got off on the wrong foot.

228
00:09:57,279 --> 00:09:57,919
So I

229
00:09:58,039 --> 00:09:59,039
have come here specially

230
00:09:59,039 --> 00:10:00,399
to make amends.

231
00:10:04,279 --> 00:10:06,320
This pill boosts Spiritual Power.

232
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:08,360
I know your difficulties,

233
00:10:08,799 --> 00:10:10,000
so I've come to give you

234
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,120
this Spirit Pill.

235
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,000
Since when are you so kind?

236
00:10:20,159 --> 00:10:20,879
I don't buy it.

237
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:28,399
Well, you're not as dumb as you look.

238
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,840
Please.

239
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:30,960
At least I've watched 76 episodes

240
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:32,679
of The Legend of Zhen Huan.

241
00:10:32,919 --> 00:10:34,279
You think I'd fall for

242
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,240
a cheap trick like this?

243
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,240
Goodbye now.

244
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,200
What are you doing?

245
00:10:44,679 --> 00:10:46,240
You brought this on yourself,

246
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,480
Xi Yuan.

247
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:49,159
Here.

248
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:50,519
Open your mouth.

249
00:10:52,879 --> 00:10:53,919
Not cooperating?

250
00:10:59,519 --> 00:11:00,080
Oh my,

251
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:00,919
I...

252
00:11:00,919 --> 00:11:01,960
I forgot to mention,

253
00:11:02,879 --> 00:11:04,559
if you take too many of these pills,

254
00:11:05,279 --> 00:11:07,080
your body will explode.

255
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:17,640
(Hall of Longevity, Martial Trial)

256
00:11:20,919 --> 00:11:21,519
I...

257
00:11:21,519 --> 00:11:22,440
I yield!

258
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:23,559
I yield!

259
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:27,039
Miss Liu is defeated!

260
00:11:27,039 --> 00:11:28,639
Miss Xia Honglian

261
00:11:28,639 --> 00:11:31,000
advances to the final duel!

262
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,799
It seems the position of Crown Princess

263
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:36,120
will surely belong to Miss Xia Honglian.

264
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,279
Then you

265
00:11:37,679 --> 00:11:39,759
will be the father-in-law
of the Crown Prince.

266
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:41,480
Oh my,

267
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,080
you flatter me.

268
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:43,960
The title matters little.

269
00:11:44,159 --> 00:11:46,240
What matters is being able
to assist His Highness.

270
00:11:46,879 --> 00:11:47,679
Ah yes,

271
00:11:47,919 --> 00:11:48,960
the Crown Prince

272
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,240
is still young after all.

273
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:52,120
His experience in statecraft

274
00:11:52,279 --> 00:11:53,919
is somewhat lacking.

275
00:11:55,639 --> 00:11:56,159
Is that so?

276
00:11:56,639 --> 00:11:57,679
Minister Xia,

277
00:11:57,679 --> 00:11:59,080
are you already pondering

278
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:01,159
how to instruct me in the future?

279
00:12:01,159 --> 00:12:02,120
I wouldn't dare.

280
00:12:03,679 --> 00:12:06,279
Greetings, Your Highness!

281
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,159
Have you found her?

282
00:12:11,799 --> 00:12:12,399
Your Highness,

283
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,960
could she have chickened out
and run away?

284
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:18,080
Announce the results.

285
00:12:18,759 --> 00:12:20,200
I hereby declare

286
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,679
Miss Xia Honglian

287
00:12:21,679 --> 00:12:24,639
has won sixteen consecutive matches
in under half an hour,

288
00:12:24,639 --> 00:12:27,159
thus claiming the martial trial.

289
00:12:27,519 --> 00:12:28,240
Hold on!

290
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,039
Xi Yuan?

291
00:12:34,799 --> 00:12:35,919
Miss Xia,

292
00:12:35,919 --> 00:12:36,960
I'm sorry

293
00:12:37,039 --> 00:12:38,039
to disappoint you.

294
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:45,440
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,♪

295
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:48,400
♪the envy of everyone♪

296
00:12:48,400 --> 00:12:52,480
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,♪

297
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:55,560
♪leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

298
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:59,040
♪No matter how long or hard our road,♪

299
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:01,840
♪I don't care♪

300
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:05,880
♪But you left me with this pain,♪

301
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:08,880
♪forever beyond redemption♪
